uctID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"68352187\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><strong>JIADI Cast Iron Self-Suction Screw Pump</strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><img src=\"/admin.seo.com.cn/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271317243606517.jpg\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\">JIADI pumps are all manufactured based on absorbing domestic and foreign advanced technology and advantages. We mainly devote to product manufacturing as well as promoting and selling of accessories for pumps. We offer Cast Iron Self-Suction Screw Pump to bring convenience to our customers.</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271317203302791.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image005(001).jpg\"/></p><p><br/></p><p><strong>1.  Product Specification</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td valign=\"top\" width=\"140\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Model Number:</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"429\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">ZG</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"140\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Pump Type</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"429\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Self-Suction Single Screw pump</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"140\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Power</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"429\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">0.75kw</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"140\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Speed</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"429\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">2850 r/min</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"140\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Suction Height</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"429\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">9 m</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"140\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Head</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"429\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">40 m</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"140\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Housing material</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"429\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Iron</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"140\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Outlet inch</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"429\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">1&amp;rdquo;</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"140\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Inlet inch</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"429\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">1&amp;rdquo;</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271319185319416.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image009.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>3. Spare parts</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271319232236646.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image011.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>4. Production Application</strong></p><p>Self-suction single screw pump is a horizontal pump which consist of a single phase motor (or three phases motor), single screw pump and seals. It could get water from the river and remove it to the field for irrigation and so on.</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271320211522345.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image013(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>5. Company profile</strong></p><p>JIADI is a collection enterprise of development, production, sales, service as one of the enterprises of valve and pump products. The company has NEMA standard pumps. We keep contact with many customers because of our quality, energy efficient, safe, reliable, affordable pump. Our products are widely used in construction, fire safety, environmental protection, water supply and drainage.</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271320275742348.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image015(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>6. Exhibition</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271320316988172.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image017(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>7. Package and Delivery</strong></p><p>Trade terms: FOB, CIF, CFR ,etc</p><p>Payment terms: L/C, D/A, D/P, T/T (If you want other payments, please tell us)</p><p>Port: Ningbo, Lianyungang, Shanghai</p><p>Lead time: 20-30 days</p><p>Packing: Carton, wooden box or any other methods you want</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271320373777869.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image019(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>8. FAQ</strong></p><p><strong>1. Q: What’s your MOQ?</strong></p><p>A: Trial sample order is OK .</p><p><strong>2. Q: Why choose JIADI? </strong></p><p>A: We are the professional manufacturer in China for such industry.</p><p>B: We have R&amp;D team who can design fully new and automatic machine to update the processing.</p><p>C: Excellent pre-sale and after-sale services. If you give me a chance, you will get it extremely worthy value.</p><p><strong>3. Q: How do you deal with clients’ quality complaints?</strong></p><p>A: All complaints about quality will be paid much attention to. We will keep in touch with clients till finally we help them find the key of the problem.</p><p><strong><br/></strong><br/></p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: jiadi cast iron self-suction screw pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/100qjd-4-submersible-water-pump/submersible-ce-rohs-certificate-well-pump\"><img alt=\"Submersible CE RoHS Certificate Well Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/submersible-well-pump28066731870a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/100qjd-4-submersible-water-pump/submersible-ce-rohs-certificate-well-pump\">Submersible CE RoHS Certificate Well Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/3-submersible-pump/3-peripheral-submersible-pump/submersible-peripheral-pump\"><img alt=\"Submersible Peripheral Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/submersible-peripheral-pump46077857053a77d.j